{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "tbl-p0081-01",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Read the finite sequence by pairing each increasing index n from 1 through 10 with its original given term a_n. Retain both rows, eleven columns including the row labels, and all twenty numeric entries.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-0789/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/tbl-p0081-01.png",
      "sha256": "c6d2eb582584a5fd96a606b9bac82a795d0b8ca296e829fd37eac95ce74198b3"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "这种情况实际上就是利用给出函数的列表法.\n其实，上面的$(1)$行就是下表的简略写法："
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "利用项的序号$n$表示数列每一项的公式，叫做数列的通项公式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "1. 有限数列可按它的项的序号递增的顺序列出它的项的方法给出."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "例如，这样给出数列$(a_n)$：\n$1,4,9,16,25,36,49,64,81,100$. $(1)$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "2. 数列可以用说明的方法给出"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "举例说，设已知数列$(c_n)$的项是按递增的顺序取的小于20的质数.\n通过这个说明，很容易求出$c_1=2$，$c_2=3$，$c_3=5$，$c_4=7$，$c_5=11$，$c_6=13$，$c_7=17$，$c_8=19$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s1-n12",
        "text": "数列$(c_n)$是有限数列，它的项数等于8."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-table-lattice",
        "description": "Top, middle, and bottom horizontal rules extend across the table. Ten internal vertical rules separate the eleven columns and span both rows. The outer left and right sides are open. The first label column is about four data-column widths; the ten data columns and the two row heights are approximately equal. Source printing is uneven and has incidental speckles, not additional mathematical marks. Modern additions: regularized 56 px columns and two closed outer side borders; these are not source-visible facts.",
        "objects": [
          "table-lattice",
          "table-frame"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "full-table-2-by-11"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "gridDimensions"
        ]
      },
      {
